\begin{itemize}
    \item Substituting values before differentiating
    \item Forgetting negative signs (direction matters!)
    \item Not using chain rule when differentiating
    \item Mixing up which rate is given and which is unknown
    \item Unit inconsistencies
    \item Not relating variables correctly before differentiating
\end{itemize}

